                    <a
                        href="https://x.com/RandomPossibly"
                        class="team-row"
                        data-avatar="/img/mason.png"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    >
                        <span class="team-name">mason</span>
                        <span class="team-role">lead composer</span>
                    </a>
                    <p id="team-blurb">jamms is a fast moving, close-knit team of passionate designers, developers, and artists. we make things stick.<br/>for inquiries, contact <a href="mailto:fruit@jam.ms" id="team-contact">fruit@jam.ms</a></p>
